# Agentic Dev Toolkit

This repository ships the Cursor plugin `.cursor-plugin/agentic-dev-toolkit/`.

## Skills — read before acting

| Trigger | Skill path |
|---|---|
| Front / web app work | `skills/web-stack/SKILL.md` |
| Rust backend / Telegram / DB | `skills/rust-backend/SKILL.md` |
| FigCraft mockup / designer↔dev | `skills/figcraft-designer-dev/SKILL.md` |
| Any visual UI change | `skills/visual-quality-gate/SKILL.md` |
| Before Done / merge | `skills/verify-handoff/SKILL.md` |
| Any automation need | `skills/no-disposable-scripts/SKILL.md` |
| Measuring task signals | `skills/code-metrics/SKILL.md` |

Paths are relative to `.cursor-plugin/agentic-dev-toolkit/`.

## Hard rules

1. **Verify before Done** — run applicable gates; call `bin/verify-checklist`.
2. **No disposable scripts** — use `bin/` / `tools/` / repo CLI; extend them in-repo instead of `/tmp` bash.
3. **Do not reactivate Hindsight** — that plugin stays disabled (AIP-82).
4. Prefer toolbox bins under this plugin over one-off shell.

## Toolbox entry points

- `.cursor-plugin/agentic-dev-toolkit/bin/verify-checklist`
- `.cursor-plugin/agentic-dev-toolkit/bin/metrics-append`
